        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): gate compaction rotation for sqlite-backed sessions",
        "body": "Closes #104769\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where agents using sqlite-backed session storage could hit an\n`ENOENT: no such file or directory, mkdir 'sqlite:...'` error path when\ncompaction transcript rotation ran through the post-flip `run/attempt.ts` call\nsite. Rotation tries to compute a successor transcript path with\n`path.dirname(sessionFile)`, but for sqlite-backed sessions `sessionFile` is a\n`sqlite:<agentId>:<sessionId>:<storePath>` marker string, not a filesystem\npath, so the derived \"directory\" is nonsense.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`compact.ts` already guards its own rotation call with\n`!isSqliteSessionTranscript`, but `run/attempt.ts`'s call site (added after\ncompaction call sites were split) did not carry the same guard, so\nsqlite-backed sessions rotated through that path still hit the bug. Rather\nthan duplicating the guard at each call site, this moves the check inside\n`rotateTranscriptAfterCompaction()` itself (using the existing\n`parseSqliteSessionFileMarker` helper), so every current and future caller is\nprotected by construction.\n\n## User Impact\n\nAgents configured with `truncateAfterCompaction: true` and sqlite-backed\nsession storage no longer risk a rotation failure/error noise after\ncompaction; sqlite-backed sessions now cleanly skip rotation instead of\nattempting an invalid filesystem write.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Added a regression test asserting `rotateTranscriptAfterCompaction()`\n  returns `{ rotated: false, reason: \"sqlite-backed session\" }` for a\n  `sqlite:...` session file marker.\n- Proved the regression: temporarily removed the new guard and reran the test,\n  which failed with\n  `ENOENT: no such file or directory, mkdir 'C:\\...\\sqlite:test-agent:test-session:...'`\n  — matching the exact failure mode described in the issue. Restored the fix\n  and confirmed the test passes again.\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/compaction-successor-transcript.test.ts` — 13/13 passed.\n- This PR is agent-assisted (GitHub Copilot CLI); tested locally per the evidence above, CI will run full type/lint/test gates on push.\r\n",
